        "transcript": [
          {
            "startSec": 0.83,
            "endSec": 5.08,
            "text": "It's Monday here in Minneapolis, Minnesota for Super Bowl 52."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 5.08,
            "endSec": 10.15,
            "text": "Seven days till kickoff and U.S. Customs and Border Protection is already been here on the ground for a few days."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 10.15,
            "endSec": 14.54,
            "text": "Joining me now is lead field coordinator of CBP, Chief Doug Harrison."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 14.54,
            "endSec": 16.32,
            "text": "Chief, how are you?"
          },
          {
            "startSec": 16.32,
            "endSec": 17.51,
            "text": "Good, Chris. How are you?"
          },
          {
            "startSec": 17.51,
            "endSec": 20.89,
            "text": "Great, so I hear it takes a lot of uh planning and organization."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 20.89,
            "endSec": 22.8,
            "text": "Over a year just to get ready for this."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 22.8,
            "endSec": 24.3,
            "text": "What have we brought to the table this year for Super Bowl?"
          },
          {
            "startSec": 24.3,
            "endSec": 41.5,
            "text": "Chris, we brought over 150 law enforcement professionals, more than six aircraft, a non-intrusive inspection equipment scanning everything going into the stadium. And then we've got Border Patrol agents also coming in from all over the country, uh, augmenting the Minneapolis police department on game day."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 41.5,
            "endSec": 42.54,
            "text": "Awesome, Chief."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 42.54,
            "endSec": 48.01,
            "text": "Over the next week we're going to bring you stories about what's just taking place for CBP to secure the Super Bowl."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 48.01,
            "endSec": 49.6,
            "text": "Tomorrow, we're talking air security."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 49.6,
            "endSec": 53.47,
            "text": "Continue us to follow us at CBP's countdown to kickoff."
          }
        ],
        "bestMomentSec": 24.5
      }
    },
