        "transcript": [
          {
            "startSec": 0,
            "endSec": 8,
            "text": "It's day two out here at Super Bowl 52 in Minneapolis, Minnesota, and today we're talking air security with Air Marine Operations."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 8,
            "endSec": 16.5,
            "text": "Well, most of you are going to be home Super Bowl Sunday watching the game, so will we, from 1,000 feet in the air. Let's go for a ride."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 24.3,
            "endSec": 26.6,
            "text": "12549, contact departure, we'll see you."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 33,
            "endSec": 37,
            "text": "I'm the other behind us right now, but as Su says, I'm at the buildings there, it's fairly tight."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 37,
            "endSec": 43.1,
            "text": "Okay, 3.9, .9."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 43.1,
            "endSec": 53.66,
            "text": "To learn more about how U.S. Customs and Border Protection is securing the Super Bowl, check us out at www.cbp.gov on CBP's Countdown to Kickoff."
