        "transcript": [
          {
            "startSec": 0,
            "endSec": 12.3,
            "text": "Welcome back to CBP Countdown to Kickoff. There's 4 days left to Super Bowl, and the big push now is to get all the equipment into U.S. Bank Stadium. Joining me now is Supervisor Lee Takaki with the Office of Field Operations. Lee, how are you?"
          },
          {
            "startSec": 12.3,
            "endSec": 13.9,
            "text": "Very well Chris."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 13.9,
            "endSec": 17.6,
            "text": "What types of things are you guys scanning to get into the stadium for the big day on Sunday?"
          },
          {
            "startSec": 17.6,
            "endSec": 28.5,
            "text": "Well Chris, it's pretty much everything going into the stadium. All the vehicles, containers, so pretty much everything that's going to be using the game. We got the platforms, the confetti, even the liquid celebration after the game's done."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 28.5,
            "endSec": 39.2,
            "text": "So, not just are we securing the Super Bowl by air, but we're securing it by everything going in. Make sure to follow us on CBP.gov for more information on Super Bowl 52."
          }
        ],
        "bestMomentSec": 29.5
      }
