            "startSec": 0,
            "endSec": 2.5,
            "text": "Three days to CBP's countdown to kickoff."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 2.5,
            "endSec": 15,
            "text": "We've talked air security and cargo security of everything going into U.S. Bank Stadium, but what most Americans don't know is the security we have to do leading up for counterfeit goods trying to get into Minneapolis. Take this box for instance, to see what we found just last month."
          },
          {
            "startSec": 20.5,
